    "detailed_description": "When you start the game, you become a girl who wanders around the field to find the exit.<br />\r\nYou may encounter many obstacles in various terrains as you pass through the city. Among them, there are dangerous traps where you can be sent back if touched just once.<br />\r\nAt the end, you may meet the girl's friend or learn the truth about this world.<br />\r\nThere may be challenging sections in each terrain. However, the save points can always bring you back.<br />\r\nAs long as you don't give up the game, there is no 'game over.'<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease help them in their 'The Great Escape.'",
    "about_the_game": "When you start the game, you become a girl who wanders around the field to find the exit.<br />\r\nYou may encounter many obstacles in various terrains as you pass through the city. Among them, there are dangerous traps where you can be sent back if touched just once.<br />\r\nAt the end, you may meet the girl's friend or learn the truth about this world.<br />\r\nThere may be challenging sections in each terrain. However, the save points can always bring you back.<br />\r\nAs long as you don't give up the game, there is no 'game over.'<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease help them in their 'The Great Escape.'",
    "short_description": "&quot;The Great Escape&quot; is a 2D platformer game where you explore each stage, collect keys, and find the exit. Dangerous obstacles and challenging terrain may block your path, but if you keep going, you can reach the portal to escape. Help them make their escape!",
